@startuml
[*] --> DisplayTaskList
DisplayTaskList --> SearchTasks : Search by keyword/description
DisplayTaskList --> SortTasks : Sort by priority/due date
DisplayTaskList --> ViewCompleted : View completed tasks
DisplayTaskList --> ViewIncomplete : View incomplete tasks
DisplayTaskList --> AddTask : Add task to list
DisplayTaskList --> RemoveTask : Remove task from list
DisplayTaskList --> [*] : Exit

SearchTasks --> DisplayTaskList : Return to display
SortTasks --> DisplayTaskList : Return to display
ViewCompleted --> DisplayTaskList : Return to display
ViewIncomplete --> DisplayTaskList : Return to display
AddTask --> DisplayTaskList : Return to display
RemoveTask --> DisplayTaskList : Return to display
@enduml
